COMPILATION OF: E48D10

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48D10

   1 a 0000 E48D10:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2d] an internal CHARACTER VARYING member as the RIGHT
   4 a 0006      operand of a TEST compare -- [C318] measures member-LEFT in
   5 a 0006      TEST and [C317] measures literal-LEFT in a STORE; TEST with
   6 a 0006      the member on the right is the same orientation, unmeasured
   7 a 0006      there. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 line char(14) varying,
  11 c 0006       2 nxt fixed bin(15);
  12 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  13 c 0006   rec.line = 'AB';
  14 c 0013   if 'AB' = line then k = 1;
  15 c 0027   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 0049   stop;
  17 a 004C end E48D10;

CODE SIZE = 004C
DATA AREA = 0017
FREE SYMS = 3878
END  COMPILATION
